"created_at":"2019-09-03T13:18:43Z","updated_at":"2019-10-24T13:08:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2019-09-05T08:30:12Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2019-08-27T01:42:45Z","updated_at":"2019-09-03T13:51:25Z","closed_at":"2019-08-27T14:19:27Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nHaving a bean injecting an ExecutorService `@Inject ExecutorService executorService`, an Ambiguous dependencies error is thrown:\r\n```\r\n[ERROR] \t[error]: Build step io.quarkus.arc.deployment.ArcProcessor#validate threw an exception: javax.enterprise.inject.spi.DeploymentException: javax.enterprise.inject.AmbiguousResolutionException: Ambiguous dependencies for type java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService and qualifiers [@Default]\r\n[ERROR] \t- java member: org.acme.quickstart.GreetingResource#executorService\r\n[ERROR] \t- declared on CLASS bean [types=[org.acme.quickstart.GreetingResource, java.lang.Object], qualifiers=[@Default, @Any], target=org.acme.quickstart.GreetingResource]\r\n[ERROR] \t- available beans:\r\n[ERROR] \t\t- PRODUCER METHOD bean [types=[io.netty.channel.EventLoopGroup, java.util.concurrent.Executor, java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService, java.lang.Iterable<io.netty.util.concurrent.EventExecutor>, java.lang.Object, io.netty.util.concurrent.EventExecutorGroup, java.util.concurrent.ScheduledExecutorService], qualifiers=[@Default, @Any], target=io.netty.channel.EventLoopGroup produce_io_netty_channel_EventLoopGroup_bf21a9e8fbc5a3846fb05b4fa0859e0917b2202f(), declaringBean=io.quarkus.arc.runtimebean.RuntimeBeanProducers]\r\n[ERROR] \t\t- PRODUCER METHOD bean [types=[java.util.concurrent.Executor, org.eclipse.microprofile.context.ManagedExecutor, java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService, java.lang.Object], qualifiers=[@Default, @Any], target=org.eclipse.microprofile.context.ManagedExecutor getAllManagedExecutor(), declaringBean=io.quarkus.smallrye.context.runtime.SmallRyeContextPropagationProvider]\r\n```\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe ExecutorService produced by the Context Propagation extension is used (it works in 0.21.1)\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nThe build fails with the stacktrace above\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. `mvn io.quarkus:quarkus-maven-plugin:999-SNAPSHOT:create \\\r\n    -DprojectGroupId=org.acme \\\r\n    -DprojectArtifactId=getting-started \\\r\n    -DclassName=\"org.acme.quickstart.GreetingResource\" \\\r\n    -Dpath=\"/hello\" -Dextensions=\"context-propagation\"` \r\n2. Add a `@Inject ExecutorService executorService` in the `GreetingResource` class\r\n3. `mvn clean package -DskipTests`\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```properties\r\n# Add your application.properties here, if applicable.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: `Linux ggastald-laptop 5.2.9-200.fc30.x86_64 #1 SMP Fri Aug 16 21:37:45 UTC 2019 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux`\r\n - Output of `java -version`: \r\nopenjdk version \"1.8.0_212\"\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment (AdoptOpenJDK)(build 1.8.0_212-b03)\r\nOpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM (AdoptOpenJDK)(build 25.212-b03, mixed mode)\r\n\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 999-SNAPSHOT (master)\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nDoes not happen in 0.21.1","closed_by":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h